<tr>
<td><a href="img/manekineko2_013.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_013.jpg" --></a><a href="img/manekineko2_014.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_014.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/manekineko2_015.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_015.jpg" --></a><a href="img/manekineko2_016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_016.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">
アフリカ大陸に生息する、四肢がすらっとした美しいネコ。<br />
毛皮目当ての狩猟により生息数は激減。</td>
</tr>
