-->
<tr>
<th id="3">サーバル(ブラック)</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/manekineko2_001.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/manekineko2_002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_002.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/manekineko2_003.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/manekineko2_004.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_004.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">非常にレアな、サーバルのメラニズム（遺伝子の変異によって、メラニン色素が過剰に作られた）個体。</td>
</tr>
