<td><a href="img/manekineko2_007.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_007.jpg" --></a><a href="img/manekineko2_008.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/manekineko2_008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/manekineko2/img/manekineko2_008.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">胴長短足が特徴のネコ。<br />
フィギュアの個体は、鼻の左にチョンと模様がついているのがキュート。</td>
</tr>
